#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid ""
"This is volume 3 of 51, containing Tractate Pe'ah.  It discusses agriculture,"
" of harvesting, and providing food for the poor."
msgstr ""
"To tom 3 z 51, zawierający traktat Pea. Omawia rolnictwo, zbiory i "
"zapewnianie żywności ubogim."

