#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 5, Tractate Kilayim" of item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid ""
"This is volume 5 of 51, containing Tractate Kilayim.  It discusses "
"prohibitions on the mixing of different kinds, such as wearing wool and linen"
" clothing or planting anything other than grapes in a vineyard."
msgstr ""
"To tom 5 z 51, zawierający traktat Kilajim. Omawia zakazy mieszania różnych "
"rodzajów, takie jak noszenie ubrań z wełny i lnu jednocześnie albo sadzenie w"
" winnicy czegokolwiek poza winoroślą."

