#. ~ Description of variant "Talmud, Vol. 12, Tractate Challah" of item
#. "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid ""
"This is volume 12 of 51, containing Tractate Challah.  It discusses the "
"practice of baking bread with the first portion of harvested grain and "
"tithing it as an offering."
msgstr ""
"To tom 12 z 51, zawierający traktat Chala. Omawia zwyczaj pieczenia chleba z "
"pierwszej części zebranego zboża i oddawania z niego dziesięciny jako ofiary."

#. ~ Variant name of item "Talmud"
#: data/json/items/book/spiritual.json
msgid "Talmud, Vol. 13, Tractates Orlah & Bikkurim"
msgid_plural "copies of the Talmud, Vol. 13, Tractates Orlah & Bikkurim"
msgstr[0] "Talmud, tom 13, traktaty Orla i Bikurim"
